<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>PJ's Blog – Python</title><link>https://pjfordev.com/notes/python/</link><description>Recent content in Python on PJ's Blog</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en</language><atom:link href="https://pjfordev.com/notes/python/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Logging Practices: Exception Handling and Message Formatting</title><link>https://pjfordev.com/notes/python/logging_error/</link><pubDate>Mon, 16 Dec 2024 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://pjfordev.com/notes/python/logging_error/</guid><description>
